    title: 'Summer Showcase 2025 at the Buddy Holly Center',
    description:
      'Get ready for an exciting season of live music with the Summer Showcase 2025 in the Meadows Courtyard. This year’s lineup features a fantastic mix of talent that will have you marking your calendars every Thursday night. The showcase kicks off on May 15 with Velvet Grove, followed by Jenni Dale Lord on May 22 and the Jonny Verbeten Trio on May 29. June brings performances by Dustin Garrett on June 5, Mark Wallney on June 12, Mariachi Mi Tierra on June 19, and Gypsy Jayne on June 26. After a short break, July continues the fun with Chapter 23 featuring Calistro Junior and Mickie Vasquez on July 10, Joe Trevino on July 17, Joy Harris on July 24, and Hayley Burton Music on July 31. The summer wraps up in August with Mojave Sol on August 7 and Element Band on August 14. We’re thrilled to share these amazing performances with you and can’t wait to see you all under the summer skies.',
