    timezone: 'CDT',
    description:
      'Join the Silent Wings Museum on June 7 and 8, 2025, from 10 AM to 5 PM to commemorate the anniversary of the Normandy Invasion. This event honors the courageous Glider Pilots who flew unarmed gliders deep into enemy territory during D-Day, carrying troops into combat zones. Visitors can view vintage aircraft and vehicles, hear firsthand stories from Glider Pilots, and explore the unique history of the CG-4A glider. The event features living history displays and educational activities throughout both days. Admission is free.',
