    description:
      'Tom Segura is coming to The Buddy Holly Hall! The venue presale starts April 2, 2025, at 10 AM with the code: TOGETHER. Tom Segura is a renowned actor, comedian, and writer, currently touring worldwide with his Come Together tour. He’s famous for his Netflix specials like Sledgehammer (2023), Ball Hog (2020), and others, and stars in the upcoming Netflix dark comedy series Bad Thoughts. Segura is also a New York Times bestselling author and co-hosts popular podcasts including Your Mom’s House and 2 Bears 1 Cave. With numerous film and TV credits, Tom continues to entertain millions through his comedy and podcasts.',
